    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n76244" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀχλ-ίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>move by a lever, heave up</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν [λᾶαν] οὔ κε δύ᾽ ἀνέρε . . ἀπ᾽
					οὔδεος ὀχλίσσειαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					12.448
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ ἂν τόν γε [θυρεὸν] δύω καὶ
					εἴκοσ᾽ ἄμαξαι . . ἀπ᾽ οὔδεος ὀχλίσσειαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					9.242
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[νήσους] ἐκ νεάτων ὤχλισσε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Call.
					<u>Del.</u>
					33
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νῆα διὲκ πέτρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					4.962
				</span></i>
			, etc.: for <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Al.</u>
				226
			</span></i>
			
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διοχλίζω</span>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀχλιζομένων</span>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συναγομένων</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
